                  <nc xml:id="m-0089b0fb-b470-4469-9368-91e855d659b3" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-6244f3d6-af7a-478d-a37f-697829d24321" facs="#m-a73f1d74-f56f-44f5-ac89-e1f40c105818" pname="a" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-bf47fad2-8358-49e8-a53b-a6c75ae2fac4"><lg xml:id="m-505a24fc-6d07-4679-87f1-1ed90903c9a3"><l xml:id="m-43366229-aac1-41b3-a515-8338f7b28976" facs="#m-4ccabc36-11bd-48e9-8318-27fbec2f60d3" label="ambiguous">1508</l><l xml:id="m-0f040558-44c7-4cc0-8c25-5abae2d945f5" facs="#m-63d4f641-3398-4d39-ab57-d1cf1ce7c0a6" label="ambiguous">Iune 26.</l><l xml:id="m-6812cf5c-4521-4ed4-a3f3-36459b325287" facs="#m-b25b4227-f3d1-43f6-8ed3-46aa5e7e077f" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Ecce quam bónum. p. 1071.</l><l xml:id="m-a54a2fdd-c21f-46c9-a78d-8c5fa71b4c75" facs="#m-63b4d776-709d-48c9-a986-d600711a96b5" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-3e9a207e-378f-4208-8c49-4ff1fb814de0" facs="#m-4a4618da-3cd0-494f-8092-e17ddb8cfdc4" label="ambiguous">H Lend¬</l><l xml:id="m-92aaef08-9eeb-4fb0-ba13-bf4a0efcb01d" facs="#m-37e6add0-bc11-4611-af96-797556e5b042" label="ambiguous">ia.—ij</l><l xml:id="m-2fbcc215-7f9e-4bd8-bf86-84082c32c83f" facs="#m-ed80b90d-bba9-443d-8313-f0912eb3b2ee" label="lyrics-like">V. Haec est vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-fe62208e-d743-4b28-af08-4faa9387d11a" facs="#m-3f81b25e-a994-474f-9082-7c6900a46b91" label="lyrics-like">ví¬</l><l xml:id="m-0edaf8f8-c3b0-4321-bc9f-de65288caa7f" facs="#m-a1b48a90-fe1d-48fe-854a-beb8f5897f65" label="lyrics-like">ra fra-tér- ni-tas, quae</l><l xml:id="m-6fe3ae8e-c74d-43c2-ad22-03c71568d588" facs="#m-73c09275-58af-462e-a520-3fe8dbb3fe3f" label="lyrics-like">cit múndi crí-mi¬ na: Chrí¬</l><l xml:id="m-69276fa1-2587-4756-bef4-e5a7a9af746a" facs="#m-58235403-7c35-4284-89c0-0e52377096a4" label="lyrics-like">stum secú¬ ta</l><l xml:id="m-b75f5900-d487-4930-95ba-57c8952f2ff3" facs="#m-754a9956-3a3a-4a0e-b073-3e5522dbd22a" label="lyrics-like">ta ténens régna“ caelésti¬</l><l xml:id="m-0e6e2769-ade3-4864-881d-e6e4ed4090b8" facs="#m-f1ac0b7e-1449-428d-a360-26e3ea78b764" label="lyrics-like">est, íncly¬</l><l xml:id="m-4b888130-6a58-4f20-bc70-432b46c7f1e3" facs="#m-e855e634-ec52-4610-a6d7-9ee3b9c153ab" label="ambiguous">a.</l><l xml:id="m-03a0b0d2-8e08-49e3-bc4c-7362559edcc4" facs="#m-003a017e-b1e2-4a6a-b1ba-53305d5c6590" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 12.</l><l xml:id="m-e1f1fed3-1226-4c4d-971d-c4847c02d8e0" facs="#m-33ae1db3-c0d3-4c1b-ad12-3fedb185c356" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus discí-uem timeátis: timéte eum, qui,</l><l xml:id="m-83e644ef-48ce-4931-9af0-ee8873d61e18" facs="#m-954a7e27-dd97-4119-84fc-1cbd9e53fb87" label="lyrics-like">L pulis suis: Atténdite a ferménto postquam occíderit, habet potestá¬</l><l xml:id="m-4d9de32a-0743-444b-b900-dc5280446084" facs="#m-e0be439c-79b2-4b39-9306-562b72c1e1f0" label="lyrics-like">Pharisaeórum, quod est hypócrisis.</l><l xml:id="m-5343386e-460e-497a-b62f-05ee95518a16" facs="#m-1b729392-9007-4c46-a08a-3d0ca9a6eba6" label="lyrics-like">tem mittere in gehénnam. Ita dico</l><l xml:id="m-a4819dc4-7ee6-4752-9b14-043df6a49cc8" facs="#m-fa7fd31d-e07f-4d60-ba82-784929d66a84" label="lyrics-like">Nihil autem opértum est, quod non</l><l xml:id="m-b79e5f59-365d-4155-9cd4-22b9abb8c1da" facs="#m-5a076bdc-00a9-460a-882a-23cafcb70993" label="lyrics-like">vobis : hunc timéte. Nonne quinque</l><l xml:id="m-8ba62768-290f-40f3-82fa-193d2aaea562" facs="#m-c4697231-9445-41ab-88b7-3f45c095c095" label="lyrics-like">revelétur: neque abscónditum, quod</l><l xml:id="m-13edb057-853a-461c-acaf-a58c645bcb10" facs="#m-7e2dd390-46e1-4c3e-9d57-1cf62ce8a899" label="lyrics-like">pásseres véneunt dipóndio, et unus</l><l xml:id="m-6718da85-7ca8-4166-aaaa-00fe65594cca" facs="#m-efeeed86-61fd-4d90-af2e-ea803003cb3b" label="lyrics-like">non sciátur. Quóniam, quae in téne¬</l><l xml:id="m-c6765bfe-7e1d-431b-a281-7cd3cb1302a1" facs="#m-76942f73-49d9-4c3d-b3ce-1862162d59cd" label="lyrics-like">ex illis non est in oblivióne coram</l><l xml:id="m-1985764c-8dda-494e-b304-1b4a82d5e2ce" facs="#m-ff844863-aaf8-4a5d-a941-f4ba73780ba5" label="lyrics-like">bris dixistis, in lúmine dicéntur : et</l><l xml:id="m-06bdde4c-092b-49fe-ac3e-f5b2b64eabdd" facs="#m-dd8f6e75-f452-40a0-a0f3-beb4c9e3c020" label="lyrics-like">Deo? Sed et capilli cápitis vestri</l><l xml:id="m-97d93c3c-56ed-4ea4-95b0-1d90c4b11de7" facs="#m-1311b171-d780-4d47-8b50-31fd76076186" label="lyrics-like">quod in aurem locúti estis in cubi¬</l><l xml:id="m-3f4aac50-afc4-46d0-ab3a-c6da7b607336" facs="#m-1d9bb3bf-8539-47f1-9d34-54f0c1a43c34" label="lyrics-like">omnes numeráti sunt. Nolite erzo</l><l xml:id="m-5fe12df8-ed99-4994-b4de-030ab60a6c49" facs="#m-eae20b04-95bc-4414-9305-bbf6f3ed6572" label="lyrics-like">culis, praedicábitur in tectis. Dico</l><l xml:id="m-2149219f-d858-4736-9f8a-ae760f92496a" facs="#m-2c7ddcc9-188b-48f0-a6a0-7aeb32c0b7f5" label="lyrics-like">timére:multis passéribus pluris estis</l><l xml:id="m-2681cf2b-1456-45c0-88f2-f23a75c52fb2" facs="#m-de039dbe-3bb8-4eae-a56f-7b0286be10a0" label="lyrics-like">autem vobis amícis meis: Ne ter¬</l><l xml:id="m-73ca3edc-ad00-4a0c-851e-f5617aab98ec" facs="#m-f3f9f13e-eeff-4c7e-9340-65476a14b10c" label="ambiguous">vos. Dico autem vobis : Omnis, qui¬</l><l xml:id="m-926d24ce-4101-4dc3-b1b4-90624e473009" facs="#m-13874b8d-d4a9-42d9-a813-1eef70b9b87a" label="lyrics-like">reámini ab his qui occídunt corpus,</l><l xml:id="m-f96faaea-abdb-4299-98c3-4133cea1944c" facs="#m-9f76d753-a203-43e1-9772-78d462dbd033" label="lyrics-like">cúmque conféssus fúerit me coram</l><l xml:id="m-7d82c866-8c72-451a-818e-1e210fa112ca" facs="#m-ce4b1729-8c63-4434-8439-ee7d493546f0" label="lyrics-like">et post haec non habent ámplius hominibus, et Filius hóminis confi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b0e5f379-0512-49be-801a-f07a4b87a23d" facs="#m-bf399db8-91ce-480b-ba42-e8b820587e08" label="lyrics-like">quid fáciant. Osténdam autem vobis! tébitur illum coram Angelis Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-4038a3ec-90f8-43f8-b767-3d41d71f39a8" facs="#m-54d1280d-613d-479e-8191-dd853402285e" label="ambiguous">orert.&amp;</l><l xml:id="m-750ec11d-0b33-43ad-9e9f-256658d81f1c" facs="#m-bdf5c097-2035-489a-a9c2-b87e5d2c6f16" label="ambiguous">YLo- r- a</l><l xml:id="m-4dc56c2c-1674-49fa-bc86-abcffc5846ba" facs="#m-c84cf899-e74b-4536-a8e3-ff47d2ce8417" label="lyrics-like">tur" in te ó¬</l><l xml:id="m-60b48600-1e5c-4577-93f0-57d1917ce440" facs="#m-81d78675-eb89-42da-a3b7-b21a0377040d" label="lyrics-like">bún¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ec49892-1802-46e8-bb89-1b5ff292fbad" facs="#m-2c6a132d-370c-436a-b8b9-8baee3d7904a" label="lyrics-like">mnes qui dí¬ li¬</l><l xml:id="m-54acd02c-0efe-4a43-933c-c0f078cf9a08" facs="#m-a66f8bb0-daf8-448b-a1d5-4670e956008a" label="lyrics-like">gunt nó-men</l><l xml:id="m-af58477f-2e16-42f0-8334-b92ee7e78cc1" facs="#m-5aab0b25-7526-4bd2-b3b2-c5ef9d836c6e" label="lyrics-like">tú- um, quó-ni-am tu,</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
